    {
      "text": "I'm somebody now, Harry.",
      "startMs": "0",
      "endMs": "3000",
      "startTimeText": "0:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Everybody likes me.",
      "startMs": "3000",
      "endMs": "5000",
      "startTimeText": "0:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soon...millions of people will see me...",
      "startMs": "6000",
      "endMs": "9000",
      "startTimeText": "0:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "...and they'll all like me.",
      "startMs": "9000",
      "endMs": "12000",
      "startTimeText": "0:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll tell them about you...and your father.",
      "startMs": "12000",
      "endMs": "16000",
      "startTimeText": "0:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "How good he was to us. Remember?",
      "startMs": "16000",
      "endMs": "20000",
      "startTimeText": "0:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a reason to get up in the morning.",
      "startMs": "22000",
      "endMs": "27000",
      "startTimeText": "0:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a reason to lose weight...",
      "startMs": "27000",
      "endMs": "29000",
      "startTimeText": "0:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "...to fit in the red dress.",
      "startMs": "29000",
      "endMs": "33000",
      "startTimeText": "0:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a reason to smile.",
      "startMs": "33000",
      "endMs": "37000",
      "startTimeText": "0:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "It makes tomorrow all right.",
      "startMs": "37000",
      "endMs": "40000",
      "startTimeText": "0:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "(Sighs) What have I got Harry?",
      "startMs": "42000",
      "endMs": "45000",
      "startTimeText": "0:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mmm?",
      "startMs": "46000",
      "endMs": "48000",
      "startTimeText": "0:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "Why should I even make the bed or wash the dishes?",
      "startMs": "48000",
      "endMs": "52000",
      "startTimeText": "0:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "I do them, but why should I?",
      "startMs": "52000",
      "endMs": "57000",
      "startTimeText": "0:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm alone.",
      "startMs": "57000",
      "endMs": "59000",
      "startTimeText": "0:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your father's gone, you're gone.",
      "startMs": "59000",
      "endMs": "63000",
      "startTimeText": "0:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "I got no one to...care for.",
      "startMs": "65000",
      "endMs": "70000",
      "startTimeText": "1:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "What have I got, Harry?",
      "startMs": "70000",
      "endMs": "73000",
      "startTimeText": "1:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "(Sighs)... Im lonely.",
      "startMs": "77000",
      "endMs": "80000",
      "startTimeText": "1:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm old.",
      "startMs": "81000",
      "endMs": "83000",
      "startTimeText": "1:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "-You got friends, Ma.",
      "startMs": "84000",
      "endMs": "86000",
      "startTimeText": "1:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not the same...",
      "startMs": "86000",
      "endMs": "89000",
      "startTimeText": "1:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't need me.",
      "startMs": "90000",
      "endMs": "93000",
      "startTimeText": "1:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "I like the way I feel.",
      "startMs": "96000",
      "endMs": "99000",
      "startTimeText": "1:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "I like thinking about the red dress...",
      "startMs": "101000",
      "endMs": "104000",
      "startTimeText": "1:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "...and the television, and you, and your father.",
      "startMs": "104000",
      "endMs": "108000",
      "startTimeText": "1:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, when I get the sun, I smile.",
      "startMs": "109000",
      "endMs": "114000",
      "startTimeText": "1:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll come and visit, Ma.",
      "startMs": "119000",
      "endMs": "121000",
      "startTimeText": "1:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now that I'm straight, my business is going good...",
      "startMs": "122000",
      "endMs": "126000",
      "startTimeText": "2:02"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll come. Me and Marion...we'll come for dinner.",
      "startMs": "126000",
      "endMs": "129000",
      "startTimeText": "2:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "Good. You bring her.",
      "startMs": "129000",
      "endMs": "131000",
      "startTimeText": "2:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll make you mushroom soup and a roast.",
      "startMs": "131000",
      "endMs": "134000",
      "startTimeText": "2:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "That sounds great, Ma...That sounds great.",
      "startMs": "135000",
      "endMs": "138000",
      "startTimeText": "2:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll give you a call at the time, all right?",
      "startMs": "138000",
      "endMs": "141000",
      "startTimeText": "2:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok",
      "startMs": "141000",
      "endMs": "143000",
      "startTimeText": "2:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm glad.",
      "startMs": "144000",
      "endMs": "146000",
      "startTimeText": "2:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm glad you have a nice girl and your own business. I'm glad.",
      "startMs": "146000",
      "endMs": "151000",
      "startTimeText": "2:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "I gotta go Ma, I have an appointment in Manhattan in a little bit...",
      "startMs": "158000",
      "endMs": "162000",
      "startTimeText": "2:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "...but I'll be back.",
      "startMs": "162000",
      "endMs": "164000",
      "startTimeText": "2:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok, you still got your key?",
      "startMs": "164000",
      "endMs": "166000",
      "startTimeText": "2:44"
    },
    {
